 ('Reading · A formal email',mail('programme@civicforum.example','dr.alves@university.example','Invitation to deliver the closing address',['Dear Dr. Alves,','On behalf of the organising committee, I am writing to **invite you** to deliver the **closing address** at the Civic Forum on 14 March. We should be **honoured** if you would speak for thirty minutes on **public trust**.','The session will be **livestreamed** and a **transcript** published. Should you **be unable to attend**, we would gladly **accommodate** a recorded message. Travel and lodging will be **covered in full**.','We would **be grateful for** your reply by 15 January, so that we may **finalise** the programme.','With warm regards, Helena Cruz, Programme Chair'],gloss=[('closing address','discurso de encerramento'),('honoured','honrados'),('livestreamed','transmitido ao vivo'),('accommodate','acomodar, atender')])),
